#!/usr/bin/python3
"""Mango Store: find, install and update Debian software.

Layout inspired by the Mac's app store: sidebar with the Mango Store logo,
search and sections; a sliding banner (ArtCraft and the apps of the week);
apps on uniform rounded tiles with a round GET button that turns into a
progress ring while installing; app pages. Built on Debian's AppStream
catalog. The apps of the week come from the Debian Popularity Contest
(popcon.debian.org): the most used desktop apps you do not have yet,
three new ones each week. Installing/removing goes through
/usr/lib/mangos/store-helper (pkexec, administrator password). App pages
say how heavy an app is on this Mac and warn when it cannot run here
(mangos.appweight, /usr/share/mangos/store-requirements.conf)."""
